{"seq":9,"slug":"api-design","title":"API 设计与规范","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":4,"docCount":13,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design","rating":{"composite":3.89,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.68,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4.75}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"api-设计与规范-简介\">API 设计与规范 简介</h1><p>API 是现代软件系统的连接纽带，其设计质量直接影响系统的可维护性、可扩展性和开发者体验。一个设计良好的 API 能够降低系统间的耦合度，加速团队协作，并为未来的演进留出空间。从 REST 到 GraphQL，从 gRPC 到 WebSocket，不同的 API 范式适用于不同的场景，理解它们的设计哲学与权衡取舍是架构决策的基础。</p>\n<p>本知识库适用于有一定后端或全栈开发经验、希望系统掌握 API 设计方法论的中高级工程师。无论你是 API 的设计者、实现者还是消费者，本知识库都能帮助你做出更合理的技术选型与设计决策。</p>\n<p>全书共分为四章，覆盖主流 API 范式与工程化治理：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>REST API 设计</strong>，系统讲解 RESTful API 的设计原则、资源建模、版本管理与错误处理，帮助读者掌握目前应用最广泛的 API 设计范式。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>GraphQL</strong>，介绍 GraphQL 的核心理念与实践，涵盖类型系统、Schema 设计与查询性能优化，展示如何用 GraphQL 解决 REST 在复杂数据获取场景下的局限性。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>gRPC 与 RPC</strong>，讲解高性能远程过程调用的设计与实现，涵盖 gRPC 框架、Protobuf 序列化与流式通信模式，适用于微服务间的高效通信场景。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>API 治理</strong>，从工程管理角度审视 API 的全生命周期，涵盖文档自动化、测试策略与安全防护，帮助读者将 API 质量管理制度化。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：先学习第一章的 REST 设计，这是最基础也是应用最广的范式；然后根据项目需求选择性学习 GraphQL 或 gRPC；最后通过第四章的治理实践将 API 管理规范化。建议在学习过程中结合实际项目进行 API 设计评审练习。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rest-api-design","title":"REST API 设计","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/rest-api-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rest-principles","title":"REST 设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/rest-api-design/rest-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"resource-modeling","title":"资源建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/rest-api-design/resource-modeling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"api-versioning","title":"API 版本管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/rest-api-design/api-versioning"},{"seq":4,"slug":"error-handling","title":"错误处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/rest-api-design/error-handling"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"graphql","title":"GraphQL","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/graphql","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graphql-fundamentals","title":"GraphQL 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/graphql/graphql-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"schema-design","title":"Schema 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/graphql/schema-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-patterns","title":"GraphQL 性能模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/graphql/performance-patterns"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"grpc-and-rpc","title":"gRPC 与 RPC","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/grpc-and-rpc","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"grpc-fundamentals","title":"gRPC 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/grpc-and-rpc/grpc-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"protobuf","title":"Protocol Buffers 深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/grpc-and-rpc/protobuf"},{"seq":3,"slug":"streaming-patterns","title":"流式通信模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/grpc-and-rpc/streaming-patterns"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"api-governance","title":"API 治理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/api-governance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"api-documentation","title":"API 文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/api-governance/api-documentation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"api-testing","title":"API 测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/api-governance/api-testing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"api-security","title":"API 安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/api-governance/api-security"}]}]}